  "description": "Planning Statement – Proposed Change of Use from C3 to C2\n\nThe application seeks planning permission for the change of use of the existing dwelling house from Use Class C3 to Use Class C2 to operate a small children’s residential home.\n\nThe proposal will provide accommodation and care for up to four children within a family-style residential environment. The home will be professionally managed and staffed 24 hours a day to ensure that the safety, well-being, and support needs of the residents are met at all times.\n\nThe proposal does not include any external alterations, extensions, or operational development to the property. The dwelling will remain in its existing residential form and appearance, maintaining compatibility with the surrounding character of the area. No internal building works requiring planning permission are proposed.\n\nThe scale of the operation is intended to remain small and domestic in nature, with staffing arrangements designed to minimise disturbance to neighbouring occupiers. The use is expected to function in a manner comparable to a large family household and will not materially alter the residential character of the locality.\n\nThe proposal will provide an important community benefit through the provision of high-quality residential care accommodation for children in a stable and supportive home environment.",
